---
layout: base
---

{# Private LLM wiki page with the full site chrome (header/nav/breadcrumb, footer, theme toggle — all from base.njk). Unlike post.njk this is NOT an h-entry: no microformats, no webmentions, no feed, no entry-footer — so the posts' IndieWeb machinery never sees it. See the spec, _local/design/Plan - Wiki as a real post type.md. The eyebrow's /wiki/ link doubles as the way back to the index; on the index page it's a harmless self-link. #}
<div class="region" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-xl-2xl)">
  <article class="wrapper flow prose">
    <p class="wiki-eyebrow | popout">
      Part of the <a href="/wiki/">JEDEE wiki</a> — pages written by an AI (Claude Code), supervised by Johan.
    </p>

    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>

    {% if date %}
      <p class="meta">
        {% set definedDate = date %}{% include "partials/date.njk" %}
      </p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="wrapper-pass flow">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>

    {% include 'partials/backlinks.njk' %}
  </article>
</div>

{%- css "local" -%}
  {%- include 'css/wiki.css' -%}
{%- endcss -%}
